    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58868" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κονδῠλ-ίζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόνδυλος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strike with
				the fist</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hyp.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				98
			</span></i> (
				Act.
			 and 
				Pass.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Aristid.
				2.95
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>maltreat, oppress</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρφανούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ma.</u>
					3.5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς κεφαλὰς πτωχῶν</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Am.</u>
				2.7
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὑτὴν εἰς ἀνάμνησιν κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Decl.</u>
					26.20
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ συνηθείας ἀεὶ
				κεκονδυλισμένος</span> inured to <i>buffetings</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				44.4
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				2.21
			</span></i>.</div>
